# Files excluded from the API deployment bundle.
#
# The whole repository is uploaded before the function is built, and the bundle
# has a hard size ceiling, so anything the request path never reads is excluded
# here. The frontend is on the list because it is a separate Vercel project with
# its own root directory; a copy of it inside the API bundle costs size for
# nothing.
#
# Every root-level entry is written with a leading slash on purpose. Without it
# these behave like gitignore patterns and match at ANY depth, which would take
# backend/demo/scenarios/ out of the bundle along with the repository's own
# demo/ directory -- and the scenario endpoints read those fixtures at runtime.

/frontend/
/ui_insipration/
/design-system/
/backup/
/conversations/
/memory/
/demo/
/docs/
/scripts/
/tools/
/tmp/
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.pytest_cache/

backend/tests/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

*.mp4
*.zip
.env
.env.*
